<p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: normal; background: white;"><strong><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;">Front Camera: 16-MP</span></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: normal; background: white;"><strong><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;">OS: Android 10</span></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: normal; background: white;"><strong><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;">Skin: Oxygen OS 12</span></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: normal; background: white;"><strong><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;">Wi-Fi: 802.1 a/b/g/n/ac/6</span></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: normal; background: white;"><strong><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;">Bluetooth: V5.1, A2DP, LE, aptX HD</span></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: normal; background: white;"><strong><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;">GPS: Yes</span></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: normal; background: white;"><strong><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;">NFC: Yes</span></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: normal; background: white;"><strong><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;">Headphone: Type-C</span></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: normal; background: white;"><strong><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;">SIM 1/2: Nano, GSM/CDMA, 3G, 4G, 5G</span></strong></p>
